      "updated": 1786536832141,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "b = batch dim (we assume batch = 1 in the diagram, to keep things simple)\nn = num heads / head index\ns = sequence length / position (s_Q and s_K are the same, but indexed to distinguish them)\ne = embedding dimension (also called d_model)\nh = head size (also called d_head, or d_k)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
